# Contributing

Refer to the [Ansible community guide](https://docs.ansible.com/ansible/devel/community/index.html).

## Getting Started with Development

### Requirements

- RHEL or Ubuntu environment
- Docker:
  - [RHEL](https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/rhel/)
  - [Ubuntu](https://docs.docker.com/engine/install/ubuntu/)
- System packages for your platform:

```bash
# RHEL
sudo dnf install -y python3.9 python3.12 rsync curl
```

```bash
# Ubuntu
sudo apt-get update
sudo apt-get install -y python3.12 python3.12-venv python3-pip rsync curl
```

- Python dependencies and tools:

```bash
python3.12 -m venv custom-venv
source custom-venv/bin/activate
python -m pip install --upgrade pip
python -m pip install docsible
python -m pip install ansible-core==2.20.4
python -m pip install ansible-dev-tools
python -m pip install "molecule-plugins[docker]"
python -m pip install tenacity
python -m pip install pre-commit

# Install Cosign (Optional)
curl -O -L "https://github.com/sigstore/cosign/releases/v2.2.4/download/cosign-linux-amd64"
sudo mv cosign-linux-amd64 /usr/local/bin/cosign
sudo chmod +x /usr/local/bin/cosign
```

- Or install the dependencies from `test-requirements.txt` and `test-requirements.yml`.
